      440.49,
      286.45,
      536.72
    ],
    "text": "The details of land expected to acquire : 02 land lots with extend of 0.4269 Hectare which described in 1st lot of AM/4278 surveyed by the Ampara District Senior Superintendent of Survey where situated at Paragakale West village of Wewgampaththu North of Divisional Secretariat, Ampara in the Ampara District of Eastern Province.",
